{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Lost Colony \u2013 Uncover the Secrets of a Doomed World</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Stranded on a long-abandoned space colony, you must fight to survive against relentless alien horrors and rogue security drones. <strong>Lost Colony</strong> is a fast-paced <strong>twin-stick shooter roguelike</strong> that challenges you to <strong>adapt, explore, and uncover</strong> the truth hidden beneath the planet\u2019s surface.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd25 <strong>Intense Twin-Stick Combat</strong> \u2013 Take on waves of deadly creatures and malfunctioning defense systems with fluid, responsive controls. Dodge, shoot, and strategize your way through relentless battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2410440/extras/FlashstepGIF.gif?t=1739517600\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf0c <strong>A Mysterious, Hostile World</strong> \u2013 Explore the remnants of a forgotten colony, from derelict research labs to eerie alien caverns, each hiding dangers and secrets waiting to be uncovered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2410440/extras/ChestGIF.gif?t=1739517600\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f <strong>Upgrade &amp; Adapt</strong> \u2013 Collect <strong>tech parts</strong> from fallen enemies and hidden caches to enhance your weapons, unlock powerful abilities, and improve your chances of survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2410440/extras/BuyLaserGIF.gif?t=1739517600\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\udd16 <strong>Boost Your Drone Companion</strong> \u2013 Discover <strong>power-ups</strong> during your runs to enhance your drone\u2019s abilities, from defensive shields to devastating energy blasts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2410440/extras/ChestGIF-2.gif?t=1739517600\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd04 <strong>Procedurally Generated Challenges</strong> \u2013 No two runs are the same! Each playthrough offers fresh enemy encounters, level layouts, and loot to keep the experience dynamic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2410440/extras/LaserGIF.gif?t=1739517600\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd0e <strong>Unravel the Colony\u2019s Dark Past</strong> \u2013 What happened to the settlers? Who\u2014or what\u2014is lurking in the shadows? Piece together the story as you fight for survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Do you have what it takes to uncover the <strong>Lost Colony\u2019s</strong> secrets before it's too late?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2410440?t=1739517600","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2410440/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1739517600","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2410440/e6628f3c67228b6a7f8b83ae353fe6971975dd85/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1739517600","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2410440/e6628f3c67228b6a7f8b83ae353fe6971975dd85/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1739517600","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Lost Colony \u2013 Uncover the Secrets of a Doomed World</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Stranded on a long-abandoned space colony, you must fight to survive against relentless alien horrors and rogue security drones. <strong>Lost Colony</strong> is a fast-paced <strong>twin-stick shooter roguelike</strong> that challenges you to <strong>adapt, explore, and uncover</strong> the truth hidden beneath the planet\u2019s surface.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd25 <strong>Intense Twin-Stick Combat</strong> \u2013 Take on waves of deadly creatures and malfunctioning defense systems with fluid, responsive controls. Dodge, shoot, and strategize your way through relentless battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2410440/extras/FlashstepGIF.gif?t=1739517600\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf0c <strong>A Mysterious, Hostile World</strong> \u2013 Explore the remnants of a forgotten colony, from derelict research labs to eerie alien caverns, each hiding dangers and secrets waiting to be uncovered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2410440/extras/ChestGIF.gif?t=1739517600\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f <strong>Upgrade &amp; Adapt</strong> \u2013 Collect <strong>tech parts</strong> from fallen enemies and hidden caches to enhance your weapons, unlock powerful abilities, and improve your chances of survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2410440/extras/BuyLaserGIF.gif?t=1739517600\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\udd16 <strong>Boost Your Drone Companion</strong> \u2013 Discover <strong>power-ups</strong> during your runs to enhance your drone\u2019s abilities, from defensive shields to devastating energy blasts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2410440/extras/ChestGIF-2.gif?t=1739517600\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd04 <strong>Procedurally Generated Challenges</strong> \u2013 No two runs are the same! Each playthrough offers fresh enemy encounters, level layouts, and loot to keep the experience dynamic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2410440/extras/LaserGIF.gif?t=1739517600\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd0e <strong>Unravel the Colony\u2019s Dark Past</strong> \u2013 What happened to the settlers? Who\u2014or what\u2014is lurking in the shadows? Piece together the story as you fight for survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Do you have what it takes to uncover the <strong>Lost Colony\u2019s</strong> secrets before it's too late?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["Digital Sagas LLC"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2410440/header.jpg?t=1739517600","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"This Game was developed by Digital Sagas LLC and is Made and Owned by Digital Sagas LLC.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> SteamOS</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Sonoma 14.0<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> M2 Pro<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Grap